# 濡傛灉璁剧疆锛岄渶瑕佸湪璇锋眰澶存垨鏌ヨ鍙傛暟涓彁渚?
# PPROF_TOKEN=your-secret-token-here

# 鏄惁鍚敤寮€鍙戝伐鍏凤紙鐢熶骇鐜闇€鏄惧紡 true锛?
# - 琛ㄥ崟婕旂ず锛歭ocal/development/test 榛樿鍙
# - 浠ｇ爜鐢熸垚鍣細浠?local/development 榛樿鍙锛坱est 榛樿闅愯棌锛岄渶 APP_ENABLE_DEV_TOOL=true锛?
APP_ENABLE_DEV_TOOL=false

# 绀轰緥涓氬姟妯″潡寮€鍏筹紙绾?RBAC 鍚庡彴鍙叧闂鍗?鏀粯绀轰緥锛?
MODULE_ORDERS_ENABLED=true
# Demo / secondary-dev only (notify/query/refund unfinished). Keep false unless you need the UI.
MODULE_SCHEDULE_DEMO_ENABLED=true
MODULE_PAYMENTS_ENABLED=true
# Comma-separated gateway types to enable (must match RegisterPaymentGateway Type()).
# Empty / * / all = all registered drivers. Production: set an explicit allowlist (e.g. wechat,alipay).
# New channel checklist: add app/payment/gateways/<type>.go (SDK via go.mod OR hand-written) 鈫?append type here 鈫?optional PAYMENT_METHOD_TYPES + fields + i18n.
# Example: PAYMENT_GATEWAYS_ENABLED=wechat,alipay
# PAYMENT_GATEWAYS_ENABLED=

# 浠ｇ爜鐢熸垚鍣ㄥ墠绔洰鏍囷細react | vue | react,vue | both锛堜富鍙戣揣涓?React锛屽缓璁?react,vue锛?
CODE_GENERATOR_FRONTEND=react,vue


# AI 閰嶇疆锛堜唬鐮佺敓鎴愬櫒 AI 杈呭姪 + AI 瀹為獙瀹わ紱鏈厤缃?API Key 鏃剁浉鍏宠彍鍗?鏍囩椤佃嚜鍔ㄩ殣钘忥級
