# 鍏煎鍒悕锛堜笌涓婃柟浜岄€変竴鍗冲彲锛夛細OPENAI_API_KEY銆丱PENAI_BASE_URL


# OpenTelemetry锛堥粯璁ゅ叧闂紱閰嶇疆 exporter 鍚庤嚜鍔ㄥ惎鐢?Telemetry runner 涓?HTTP 杩借釜锛?
# 瀵煎嚭鍣ㄥ悕绉伴渶涓?config/telemetry.go exporters 閿竴鑷?
# OTEL_TRACES_EXPORTER=otlptrace
# OTEL_METRICS_EXPORTER=otlpmetric
# OTEL_LOGS_EXPORTER=otlplog
# OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_TRACES_ENDPOINT=http://127.0.0.1:4318
# OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_METRICS_ENDPOINT=http://127.0.0.1:4318
# OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_LOGS_ENDPOINT=http://127.0.0.1:4318
# OTEL_PROPAGATORS=tracecontext
# OTEL_TRACES_SAMPLER_TYPE=always_on
# OTEL_TRACES_SAMPLER_RATIO=0.05
# 鏈湴璋冭瘯鍙厛鐢?console锛歄TEL_TRACES_EXPORTER=console


# HTTP Request Timeout (in seconds, default 300 seconds = 5 minutes)
HTTP_REQUEST_TIMEOUT=300

# 瀹氭椂浠诲姟娴嬭瘯棰戠巼锛圕ron锛?
# 姣?绉? */5 * * * * *
# 姣?0绉? */10 * * * * *
# 姣忓垎閽? */1 * * * *
# SCHEDULE_TEST_CRON=*/5 * * * * *


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Prometheus metrics scrape (GET /metrics)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# METRICS_ENABLED=false
# METRICS_TOKEN=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OIDC / Enterprise SSO (admin login)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OIDC_ENABLED=false
# OIDC_ISSUER=https://login.microsoftonline.com/{tenant}/v2.0
# OIDC_CLIENT_ID=
# OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET=
# OIDC_REDIRECT_URL=https://api.example.com/api/admin/auth/oidc/callback
# OIDC_FRONTEND_REDIRECT=https://admin.example.com/login/oidc-callback
# OIDC_SCOPES=openid profile email
# OIDC_BUTTON_LABEL=Enterprise SSO
# OIDC_AUTO_PROVISION=false

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Audit log retention (days) for scheduled operation/login log archives
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AUDIT_LOG_RETENTION_DAYS=30
